$ PARAMETERS ARE TAKEN FROM
$
$ [11Ren]
$ Thermodynamic assessments of six binary systems of alkali metals,
$ X.Ren, C.Li, Z.Du, C.Guo, CALPHAD, 35 (2011) 446-454.
